1
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,460
Y 'all move!

2
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:04,145
With Kaiba still reeling
from his loss to Yugi,

3
00:01:04,260 --> 00:01:06,417
it's the perfect time to
seize control and bring

4
