this company's reputation
back to what it once was.

5
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,616
Patience, gentlemen.

6
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:14,297
Once I defeat little Yugi,
Kaiba's company will become ours.

7
00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:17,417
Of course, had you disposed of
Kaiba as originally promised,

8
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:19,177
we would have already assumed power.

9
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:20,201
But don't worry.

10
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:22,480
We'll finish what you started. No.

11
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:25,937
No one is to lay even a
finger upon Seto Kaiba.

12
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:28,157
But if he's able to rescue
his younger brother,

13
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:30,711
we'll lose our only tie to the Kaiba name!

14
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,937
Mokuba's future role
as figurehead will not

15
00:01:33,020 --> 00:01:35,357
be jeopardized by his
older brother's presence.

16
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,616
Trust me, gentlemen.

17
00:01:36,980 --> 00:01:42,100
I have my own plans for Seto Kaiba and
the technical knowledge he possesses.

18
00:01:44,180 --> 00:01:46,240
Don't fail us. Gentlemen,

19
00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:49,677
Kaiba Corp is about to enter
a new era of prosperity

20
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:53,200
and you are all about to
become obscenely rich.

21
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,980
As for you, Kaiba,

22
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,857
our partnership is just beginning

23
00:02:02,940 --> 00:02:03,817
I

24
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:10,657
can't believe

25
00:02:10,740 --> 00:02:11,570
all my business

26
00:02:11,653 --> 00:02:15,120
associates would turn on me
after a single defeat Then again,

27
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:18,064
losing to Yugi has shaken
my self-confidence too

28
