Maybe Yugi was right, but I can't
start second-guessing myself now.

34
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:52,257
Not when Pegasus has kidnapped
my little brother, Mokuba.

35
00:02:52,340 --> 00:02:55,240
No, if I'm gonna face off against Pegasus.

36
