I have to rely on my
old dueling instincts.

37
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:01,417
That's the only chance I
have of freeing Mokuba.

38
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:02,500
Big brother!

39
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:08,380
And once Mokuba is out of harm's way,

40
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:12,637
I'll unleash my wrath on the vultures
who conspired to take over my company.

41
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:16,957
If Pegasus thought I would just sit idly
by as they dismantled my life's work,

42
