43
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:23,900
I'll see to it that they all
regret ever crossing, said Okaiba.

44
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:42,355
Bakura, am I seeing things, or is
your Millennium Ring actually glowing?

45
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:45,089
If it's not, then we're
both hallucinating.

46
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:47,097
That's kind of spooky, don't you think?

47
