connected to these Millennium Items?

70
00:04:52,340 --> 00:04:54,717
First, there was Pegasus's Millennium Eye.

71
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,800
And now, Bakura's Millennium Ring.

72
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:59,260
And, of course, my Millennium Item.

73
00:05:00,020 --> 00:05:02,840
Ever since I first solved
that ancient puzzle,

74
00:05:03,100 --> 00:05:05,806
