Now, every time I duel, I can feel a
strong, courageous presence within me.

76
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:16,000
And whatever that spirit is, I pray
it will help me save my grandpa.

77
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:17,120
I miss him.

78
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:18,920
I miss him so much.

79
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:20,570
