huh actually kaiba i
was thinking that since

95
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:27,077
we're all headed for
pegasus's castle you could

96
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:30,637
stick with us of course
you'll need some star

97
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:34,177
chips don't be so naive
this isn't just a game

98
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:38,437
for me yuki i'm going
after pegasus to save my

99
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:42,497
brother not so i can win
some silly prize have

100
