236
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:33,680
That's right, Joey. Stay down.

237
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:37,477
Stay down like the sniveling,
defeated dog I've turned you into.

238
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:38,972
Are you all right, Joey?

239
00:14:42,160 --> 00:14:43,280
It's okay, kiddo.

240
00:14:43,800 --> 00:14:46,917
