has proven quite effective.

241
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:50,937
Not only did its stunning realism jar
Joey into complete and utter submission,

242
00:14:51,020 --> 00:14:52,340
but just look at him.

243
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:56,097
He's moping like a frightened dog
with his tail between his legs,

244
00:14:56,180 --> 00:14:59,280
