intend to leave Pegasus.

245
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:00,580
But this is Joey.

246
00:15:01,060 --> 00:15:02,140
Yeah, you jerk.

247
00:15:02,340 --> 00:15:05,017
Did you have to take his
confidence away with his dragon?

248
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:08,017
Joey was just starting to
believe in himself as a duelist.

249
00:15:08,100 --> 00:15:08,930
That's right.

250
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:11,777
