the right to humiliate him.

251
00:15:11,860 --> 00:15:12,690
Quiet, Yugi.

252
00:15:12,773 --> 00:15:14,994
Don't give that creep the satisfaction.

253
00:15:16,060 --> 00:15:19,237
Look, kid, do you honestly believe
that if you were dueling Pegasus,

254
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,717
he would have been any more
merciful with you than I was?

255
00:15:21,800 --> 00:15:24,097
I understand that the
heart of the cards is a

256
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:26,717
powerful philosophy and that
it all works well for you,

257
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:28,777
but I need to duel my own way now.

258
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:32,117
I can't risk trying something new,
and maybe Joey shouldn't either,

259
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,965
unless he likes life as a dog,

260
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:38,297
scrounging on the scraps of past victories
and begging for mercy from true duelists.

261
00:15:38,380 --> 00:15:41,780
Please, Kaiba, that's just
not true, and you know it.

262
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:44,180
Oh, yeah? Well,

263
00:15:44,300 --> 00:15:46,217
that's the attitude you
have to take if you want

264
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:48,817
to stand a chance against
Maximilian Pegasus.

265
00:15:48,900 --> 00:15:50,520
You don't understand, Yugi.

266
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:53,237
This is the man who created Duel Monsters.

267
00:15:53,320 --> 00:15:56,397
He has every card that's ever
been made at his disposal.

268
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:59,598
He's mastered every strategy
that's ever been played.

269
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:05,517
Pegasus always makes sure that he has every
possible advantage working in his favor.

270
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:08,700
If I'm to stand any
chance against him at all,

271
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:11,369
I'll have to play by
my own ruthless rules.

272
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:13,257
not his.

273
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:14,600
Open your eyes.

274
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:19,097
Even with your prodigious talents, Yugi,
you'll be defeated like all the others.

275
00:16:19,180 --> 00:16:23,060
Because when Pegasus duels, he
uses much more than mere skill.

276
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,951
I've seen him use a magic

277
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:27,717
that's stronger than any card.

278
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:31,440
It was at the Intercontinental
Tournament in New York City.

279
00:16:32,620 --> 00:16:35,877
I had been invited as
Pegasus' guest of honor.

280
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:40,820
A skilled hotshot duelist called Bandit
Keith had made it to the final match.

281
00:16:41,160 --> 00:16:45,677
He was playing well, but I could see that
Pegasus was still just toying with him.

282
00:16:45,760 --> 00:16:47,980
Of course, Keith had no idea.

283
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:52,597
I wish you could see the
expression on your face, Pegasus.

284
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:53,800
It's priceless.

285
00:16:54,120 --> 00:16:57,460
Tell you what, if you ask
nice, I'll finish you fast.

286
00:16:57,760 --> 00:17:00,420
Boy, I want to be a duelist like him.

287
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:05,600
This card clinches it for me.

288
00:17:06,480 --> 00:17:08,520
Any final words, cutie pie?

289
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,820
Hey, I'm talking to you.

290
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:15,894
Pegasus just stared straight into
Keith's eyes with unnerving confidence.

291
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:17,837
Then he scribbled something on a piece of

292
00:17:17,920 --> 00:17:20,626
paper and called over
some kid from the crowd.

293
00:17:21,900 --> 00:17:23,440
Hey, what are you doing?

294
00:17:23,660 --> 00:17:25,200
Asking for help's illegal!

295
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:27,640
I don't need help.

296
00:17:27,820 --> 00:17:32,100
A child could defeat you, Bandit
Keith, and I'm going to prove it.

297
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:35,197
But I just started to learn
how to play last week.

298
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:37,986
Just follow these
instructions and you'll win.

299
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:43,740
What's he up to?

300
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:45,900
Hello, Kaiba.

301
00:17:48,300 --> 00:17:51,124
I do hope you're enjoying
the tournament so far.

302
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:53,840
Oh, I know it must seem so crude to you.

303
00:17:54,140 --> 00:17:58,846
Not like the holographic dueling stations
your company is developing, eh, Kaiba?

304
00:18:01,140 --> 00:18:04,857
If Pegasus thinks he's going to throw
off my game with his lame theatrics,

305
00:18:04,940 --> 00:18:05,881
he's dead wrong.

306
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:08,600
I've got this match in the bag.

307
00:18:10,440 --> 00:18:11,417
Garnicia Elephantis.

308
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:12,380
Good card.

309
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:17,151
But the note says when you play that,
I should play this one in attack mode.

310
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:18,600
No way!

311
00:18:19,100 --> 00:18:21,747
Uh, I think I just took
all your life points.

312
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:23,590
What?!

313
00:18:23,673 --> 00:18:24,737
You little snot-nosed brat!

314
00:18:24,820 --> 00:18:27,857
There is no way you could have
known I was gonna play that card!

315
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:28,770
Gimme that!

316
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:31,400
It's all here!

317
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:34,188
The card I play, how
to beat it, everything!

318
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:35,990
Huh?

319
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:38,720
Sam is the winner.

320
00:18:40,540 --> 00:18:41,370
Ah.

321
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:44,337
I still don't know how he did it.

322
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:47,177
I only hope my new dual
disk system will give

323
00:18:47,260 --> 00:18:49,657
me the edge I need to
beat him once and for all.

324
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:53,420
That story, it reminds me
of when I faced Pegasus.

325
00:18:53,620 --> 00:18:57,000
I see you're about to use
a Komori Dragon. What?

326
00:18:57,420 --> 00:19:01,317
I know every move you'll make
before you can even make it.

327
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:04,700
It was like Pegasus was
able to see all my cards.

328
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:06,460
But Kaiba,

329
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:09,097
that's still no excuse
to take it out on us

330
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:11,777
and turn Joey into your
new system's guinea pig.

331
00:19:11,860 --> 00:19:12,690
Perhaps.

332
00:19:12,773 --> 00:19:16,557
But that system could be my only way
to beat Pegasus, so I had to test it.

333
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,977
This is war for me, Yugi.

334
00:19:18,060 --> 00:19:19,648
Your friend was a casualty.

335
00:19:22,380 --> 00:19:24,897
Kaiba, we may not agree
with each other's methods,

336
00:19:24,980 --> 00:19:28,568
but at least we both understand
that Pegasus must be stopped.

337
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:32,917
I hope you succeed in
rescuing your brother.

338
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:35,337
And I hope you succeed in your ventures.

339
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:39,420
Let's just hope our paths don't
cross again before this is all over.

340
00:19:45,100 --> 00:19:46,960
I can sense you, Kaiba.

341
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:51,920
But are you hunting for me?

342
00:19:52,380 --> 00:19:54,260
Or am I hunting you?

343
00:20:31,980 --> 00:20:33,180
Thank you.
